menu "Passport diagnostics"
    config PASSPORT_DIAGNOSTICS
        bool "Log bounded heap, input and BLE diagnostics"
        default n
        help
            Log startup internal heap and, for 180 seconds after the UI starts,
            ADC ranges, backlight transitions, button events and LVGL update times.
            BLE transition logging runs for 180 seconds after BLE startup and
            each advertising window plus ten seconds. NVS failure codes are
            logged before the failed store becomes unavailable. This
            does not change button thresholds, event admission or Lock behavior.
            Use only for device diagnosis; serial logging and additional ADC
            reads affect timing. No credentials or peer identities are logged.
endmenu
